TZV2P-MOLOPT-GTH: transcribed from CP2K's BASIS_MOLOPT by scripts/cp2k2bsd (H C N O)
PP-PROVENANCE H=1 C=4 N=5 O=6
Coefficients as CP2K states them (normalized primitives); one shell per CP2K contraction, the set's exponents shared.
CP2K runs every basis SPHERICAL: compare against it with basis.spherical true.
GATE (2026-11-02, H C N O): 15 bohr box, Gamma, GTH-PADE q1/q4/q5/q6, spherical, Becke (60, GL 48), solid.densityEcut 100 Ha,
vs CP2K 1200 Ry: CH4 -8.0360476 vs -8.0360472 (-0.4 uHa), NH3 -11.7045881 vs -11.7045887 (+0.6), H2O -17.1846307 vs
-17.1846334 (+2.6).  STATE densityEcut: the AUTO value truncates the density's G-ball on the sharp O/N pairs (OpenWork
density-ball row; dzvp_molopt_gth.bsd measured 11 / 66 / 330 uHa there).  Run it on a stated Becke mesh.

!
